# This matters more here than in most repos: design decisions live in the commit
# messages, so blame is how they are reached. A mechanical commit sitting in
# front of them hides every one it touched.
#
# Turn it on once, per clone:
#
#   git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs

